<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK DEC DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.54 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK DEC DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.54 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.54 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Dec 5			 7,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Dec		6,339</p>
<p> Average reserves to Dec 2			    3,493</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,536</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
